{"catch":"一步一腳印，打造你的燈具帝國！","desc":"《Lamp Clicker》是一款簡單又令人著迷的增量／閒置點擊類遊戲，你的目標是建立屬於自己的……燈具帝國。\n\n點擊一盞燈。\n燈開始發光。\n你的收入隨之增加。\n你感到滿滿的成就感。\n\n你解鎖了新的燈具——從普通的蠟燭和油燈……到越來越古怪的創作，那些你寧願不去深思的設計（沒錯，我們指的就是你，廁所燈）。\n\n你開始思考……這到底有沒有意義？\n你繼續點擊……","publisher":"SOURCE BYTE","release":"2026-09-10","genres":["模擬"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5473fb12082e4879574e7c2e80a736578b727046003ae6b1bf1507c31d203a8c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/28cfc1d7d9c9edf865d627854c7aaf9b6837b983755ac3739cd2032e6d3863c6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/25a11a21fd39b5eb79a2bc2f59bfb760e3e6b4f365b91d80db0bf6f1a7105e5b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4bdb93840f3eed210a8d8d146b471b4e1687bd4beb2d8f474f5f4c8412f3e42d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/04be9f396901c84d9bb8f6ef43046012e38fa341cc1c45d972e6fbf7c44b9eb2.jpg"]}